{"id":"en_apocalypse-evolution-i-created-a-new-world","title":"Apocalypse Evolution: I Created a New World","titleEn":"Apocalypse Evolution: I Created a New World","description":"Chen Yan finds himself in a devastated wasteland where food is scarce, the environment is brutal, and deadly dangers lurk everywhere. Just as humanity's chances look hopeless, he gains the ability to evolve all living things. A small sapling becomes a world tree capable of governing the weather, a tortoise grows into a mountain-sized guardian beast, and a spider develops the power to weave fate itself. With his giant turtle as his mount, Chen Yan establishes his own kingdom and sets about building a new world.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/apocalypse-evolution-i-created-a-new-world/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/apocalypse-evolution-i-created-a-new-world/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Male","Fantasy","Growth","Apocalyptic","Time Travel","Rags to Riches"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvdtw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_apocalypse-evolution-i-created-a-new-world_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvdtw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_apocalypse-evolution-i-created-a-new-world_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvdtw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_apocalypse-evolution-i-created-a-new-world_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvdtw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_apocalypse-evolution-i-cre